(6353534, 940174, 125389, '<td valign="top">Imaginative, creative, awesome.  I wish I had thought of it.  I always give at least one 10 and you are it.</td>', 'Imaginative, creative, awesome.  I wish I had thought of it.  I always give at least one 10 and you are it.', '2011-03-16 16:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
