(6356031, 940732, 117474, '<td valign="top">I like this. But I think I''d''ve processed it a little more than you have. Probably just a boost in contrast although that may have over-contrasted the right hand side of the image--going through the plastic drops the contrast somewhat I think.<br/> <br/>There''s a lot to this image. Water. not water. Candidness. I quite like this. And I''m not just saying it because of our discussion. I''m saying it because all of these things are used as water bottles. Just because they are coke bottles, snapples, pepsi''s... they can all contain water, and people like me use them as water bottles after we have emptied their initial contents. This shot has a transience that is not immediately evident but that tickles my photographic sensibilities. <br/>Something else for me is the lent reference in the background. Many of my friends (being from a Catholic country) give up fizzy drinks during lent and as a result drink more water. <br/>Whether this was all planned or not I don''t know. But I got it from the image so it doesn''t matter. This got a 6 from me.</td>', 'I like this. But I think I''d''ve processed it a little more than you have. Probably just a boost in contrast although that may have over-contrasted the right hand side of the image--going through the plastic drops the contrast somewhat I think. There''s a lot to this image. Water. not water. Candidness. I quite like this. And I''m not just saying it because of our discussion. I''m saying it because all of these things are used as water bottles. Just because they are coke bottles, snapples, pepsi''s... they can all contain water, and people like me use them as water bottles after we have emptied their initial contents. This shot has a transience that is not immediately evident but that tickles my photographic sensibilities. Something else for me is the lent reference in the background. Many of my friends (being from a Catholic country) give up fizzy drinks during lent and as a result drink more water. Whether this was all planned or not I don''t know. But I got it from the image so it doesn''t matter. This got a 6 from me.', '2011-03-18 12:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6356034, 940898, 117474, '<td valign="top">Haven''t seen one of these in a while. <br/>It''s a shame the image that goes through the drops on the bottle aren''t water related.<br/>Good idea though. I like the DOF.</td>', 'Haven''t seen one of these in a while. It''s a shame the image that goes through the drops on the bottle aren''t water related.Good idea though. I like the DOF.', '2011-03-18 12:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
