(6357027, 939870, 128200, '<td valign="top">The moire pattern on this bottle is really distracting to me. Perhaps this was your intent, but I think it would have more impact in black and white.</td>', 'The moire pattern on this bottle is really distracting to me. Perhaps this was your intent, but I think it would have more impact in black and white.', '2011-03-19 14:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6357029, 940984, 128200, '<td valign="top">If the title of the picture hadn''t said it I would not have know what the subject was. I still can only barely tell that there''s a door there and there''s no sense of scale for me to go off of. The best way I could describe this photo is: Disorienting.</td>', 'If the title of the picture hadn''t said it I would not have know what the subject was. I still can only barely tell that there''s a door there and there''s no sense of scale for me to go off of. The best way I could describe this photo is: Disorienting.', '2011-03-19 14:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6357030, 940204, 128200, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but the diagonal crop just isn''t working for me. Maybe try shooting it with the camera held diagonally next time?</td>', 'I''m sorry, but the diagonal crop just isn''t working for me. Maybe try shooting it with the camera held diagonally next time?', '2011-03-19 14:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6357033, 940828, 128200, '<td valign="top">The way you set this up and lit it is just wonderful. If you could have killed the ambient light all the way you could probably have avoided the tiny bit of blur at the top, but this is not noticable unless you really look for it!</td>', 'The way you set this up and lit it is just wonderful. If you could have killed the ambient light all the way you could probably have avoided the tiny bit of blur at the top, but this is not noticable unless you really look for it!', '2011-03-19 14:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6357035, 940837, 128200, '<td valign="top">This concept really looks like one of those commercials for "health water". I like how you let the bottle sweat a little before taking the shot. You could probably have done the same thing for the apple.</td>', 'This concept really looks like one of those commercials for "health water". I like how you let the bottle sweat a little before taking the shot. You could probably have done the same thing for the apple.', '2011-03-19 14:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6357036, 940971, 128200, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous, leading lines, interesting lighting, intrigue! the only little nit pick I have is that I wonder what it would look like if the stem of the wine glass had some rim lighting going on as well.</td>', 'This is gorgeous, leading lines, interesting lighting, intrigue! the only little nit pick I have is that I wonder what it would look like if the stem of the wine glass had some rim lighting going on as well.', '2011-03-19 14:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6357038, 940955, 128200, '<td valign="top">This just fit''s together so well, the light, the rounded ice with the shape of the bottle. I wonder what it would look like with a little more empty space up top?</td>', 'This just fit''s together so well, the light, the rounded ice with the shape of the bottle. I wonder what it would look like with a little more empty space up top?', '2011-03-19 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
