(6357042, 940981, 128200, '<td valign="top">The placement of the bottle and the woven rug making a halo around it, beautiful. The strawberries just make it delicious. The sparkles in the bottle look lind of strange to me though... I think a silky smooth matte finish or a polished glass finish would have complimented the other textures better. It''s not like you have an infinite selection of awesome looking bottles like this though!</td>', 'The placement of the bottle and the woven rug making a halo around it, beautiful. The strawberries just make it delicious. The sparkles in the bottle look lind of strange to me though... I think a silky smooth matte finish or a polished glass finish would have complimented the other textures better. It''s not like you have an infinite selection of awesome looking bottles like this though!', '2011-03-19 14:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6357043, 940680, 128200, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and setup. The weathered nature of the bottle helps too!</td>', 'I like the framing and setup. The weathered nature of the bottle helps too!', '2011-03-19 14:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
