(6357290, 940665, 128200, '<td valign="top">Haha! I can''t imagine how many tries it took to get the water to do that, it''s very cool. Is there any way you could have raised your shutter speed though? Or maybe used a strobe on a lower power setting to really stop the motion of the water?</td>', 'Haha! I can''t imagine how many tries it took to get the water to do that, it''s very cool. Is there any way you could have raised your shutter speed though? Or maybe used a strobe on a lower power setting to really stop the motion of the water?', '2011-03-19 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
