(6357376, 940975, 128200, '<td valign="top">Very surreal. I think I would have liked it if the DoF covered the entire depth of the bottle, but certainly not at the expense of that gorgeous background!</td>', 'Very surreal. I think I would have liked it if the DoF covered the entire depth of the bottle, but certainly not at the expense of that gorgeous background!', '2011-03-20 01:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
