(6360200, 940924, 117474, '<td valign="top">Great image. Not a big fan of the background on this if I''m honest. I think a wider basin would have increased the negative space and drawn the eye more to our friend here. Still 7 though.</td>', 'Great image. Not a big fan of the background on this if I''m honest. I think a wider basin would have increased the negative space and drawn the eye more to our friend here. Still 7 though.', '2011-03-22 19:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360243, 940019, 129267, '<td valign="top">I didn''t score this one very well, and thought I''d let you know why. I find the composition to be a little bland. the carpeting is distracting, and so are objects in the background. It feels a bit like you just looked around the room to see if there was a water bottle around.</td>', 'I didn''t score this one very well, and thought I''d let you know why. I find the composition to be a little bland. the carpeting is distracting, and so are objects in the background. It feels a bit like you just looked around the room to see if there was a water bottle around.', '2011-03-22 20:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360245, 940116, 129267, '<td valign="top">the color and depth of field are interesting. Technically a good shot, but I feel a bit removed from the subject matter, and I don''t think the name helps in that.</td>', 'the color and depth of field are interesting. Technically a good shot, but I feel a bit removed from the subject matter, and I don''t think the name helps in that.', '2011-03-22 20:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360246, 940924, 129267, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title, but the technicals in this shot are all spot on. I wonder what It''d look like with a bit more of a tighter crop on the right side.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title, but the technicals in this shot are all spot on. I wonder what It''d look like with a bit more of a tighter crop on the right side.', '2011-03-22 20:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360249, 940923, 129267, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I think I would have cropped a bit more (square) to show just the bottom of the bottle.</td>', 'Interesting. I think I would have cropped a bit more (square) to show just the bottom of the bottle.', '2011-03-22 20:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360252, 940941, 129267, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit weird to me, mainly the green sprite cap. the lighting seems a bit harsh from the left, and I find the top left corner to be a bit distracting. the focus is great, and I like the overall clarity of the image. On a side note, the water looks like the most refreshing beverage out of the trio.</td>', 'Colors seem a bit weird to me, mainly the green sprite cap. the lighting seems a bit harsh from the left, and I find the top left corner to be a bit distracting. the focus is great, and I like the overall clarity of the image. On a side note, the water looks like the most refreshing beverage out of the trio.', '2011-03-22 20:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360254, 940689, 129267, '<td valign="top">Hey, isn''t it Voss? depth from top to bottom looks good. I find the hot spot in the middle of the image to be distracting. Any particular reason why the left side is cropped but not the right?</td>', 'Hey, isn''t it Voss? depth from top to bottom looks good. I find the hot spot in the middle of the image to be distracting. Any particular reason why the left side is cropped but not the right?', '2011-03-22 21:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360256, 940811, 129267, '<td valign="top">refreshhhhing. I like the slight black tint, adds some good contrast.</td>', 'refreshhhhing. I like the slight black tint, adds some good contrast.', '2011-03-22 21:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360258, 940972, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like your concept, and formal positioning. Something strikes me as weird about the solid white background.</td>', 'I like your concept, and formal positioning. Something strikes me as weird about the solid white background.', '2011-03-22 21:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360259, 940975, 129267, '<td valign="top">The water looks so oily when photographed in this manner. I like the strong lines created by the cap.</td>', 'The water looks so oily when photographed in this manner. I like the strong lines created by the cap.', '2011-03-22 21:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360261, 940981, 129267, '<td valign="top">I find this shot a bit overwhelming. I''m not sure if it''s the saturation of the water bottle, or the composition.</td>', 'I find this shot a bit overwhelming. I''m not sure if it''s the saturation of the water bottle, or the composition.', '2011-03-22 21:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360262, 940530, 129267, '<td valign="top">I think the title doesn''t reflect what''s happening in the image. Image quality is formally good. Wish it had more concept behind it.</td>', 'I think the title doesn''t reflect what''s happening in the image. Image quality is formally good. Wish it had more concept behind it.', '2011-03-22 21:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360265, 940513, 129267, '<td valign="top">lovely color. The background works well for this as well.</td>', 'lovely color. The background works well for this as well.', '2011-03-22 21:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360267, 940837, 129267, '<td valign="top">the hotness works well to make the water look refreshing, but less so on the apple. Bottle shape works well with the concept, and the matching of the apple to the cap was a smart choice.</td>', 'the hotness works well to make the water look refreshing, but less so on the apple. Bottle shape works well with the concept, and the matching of the apple to the cap was a smart choice.', '2011-03-22 21:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360269, 940810, 129267, '<td valign="top">hyper shart, borderline overprocessed. Depth of field is nice. Not enjoying the duotone in the water droplet as much though.</td>', 'hyper shart, borderline overprocessed. Depth of field is nice. Not enjoying the duotone in the water droplet as much though.', '2011-03-22 21:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360270, 940308, 129267, '<td valign="top">Nice conceptual photograph and title. Formally wish it were a bit darker/moodier.</td>', 'Nice conceptual photograph and title. Formally wish it were a bit darker/moodier.', '2011-03-22 21:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360274, 940898, 129267, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflections. Like the contrast as well.</td>', 'Interesting reflections. Like the contrast as well.', '2011-03-22 21:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360276, 940802, 129267, '<td valign="top">feels a bit muted, nothing really stands out to me. I wonder if this could have been composed differently to create more interest.</td>', 'feels a bit muted, nothing really stands out to me. I wonder if this could have been composed differently to create more interest.', '2011-03-22 21:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360277, 940824, 129267, '<td valign="top">Nice use of natural light. Wish this felt lest contrived. I don''t see the importance of the flowers in relationship with the bottle.</td>', 'Nice use of natural light. Wish this felt lest contrived. I don''t see the importance of the flowers in relationship with the bottle.', '2011-03-22 21:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360282, 940124, 129267, '<td valign="top">the bottom left corner has a bit of barrel distortion that I find a bit distracting. I feel that there could be some more interesting ways of displaying this "sea" of bottles.</td>', 'the bottom left corner has a bit of barrel distortion that I find a bit distracting. I feel that there could be some more interesting ways of displaying this "sea" of bottles.', '2011-03-22 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360284, 940266, 129267, '<td valign="top">A bit tightly cropped on top. The bottle is a bit odd colored. It''s a bit refreshing to see the focus on the label as opposed to the lid area.</td>', 'A bit tightly cropped on top. The bottle is a bit odd colored. It''s a bit refreshing to see the focus on the label as opposed to the lid area.', '2011-03-22 21:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360285, 940887, 129267, '<td valign="top">the text on text is distracting a bit. I wonder if there''s some other baseball reference that could have been used to fill the frame instead.</td>', 'the text on text is distracting a bit. I wonder if there''s some other baseball reference that could have been used to fill the frame instead.', '2011-03-22 21:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360288, 940945, 129267, '<td valign="top">alien bottle in a chemical substance. <br/> <br/>The background is really strange to me, and the bottle sorta leans to the left just enough to not look purposefully leaning.</td>', 'alien bottle in a chemical substance.  The background is really strange to me, and the bottle sorta leans to the left just enough to not look purposefully leaning.', '2011-03-22 21:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360289, 940131, 129267, '<td valign="top">I wish that the cap wasn''t lost in the blown out bits. form is really dynamic. Not sure what the color/lack of is doing to this.</td>', 'I wish that the cap wasn''t lost in the blown out bits. form is really dynamic. Not sure what the color/lack of is doing to this.', '2011-03-22 21:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360290, 940444, 129267, '<td valign="top">you feed your plants gatorade? :D</td>', 'you feed your plants gatorade? :D', '2011-03-22 21:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360293, 940662, 129267, '<td valign="top">A bit too high key. Initial reaction was that the bottom portion is ice (not defeated bottles)</td>', 'A bit too high key. Initial reaction was that the bottom portion is ice (not defeated bottles)', '2011-03-22 21:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360294, 940676, 129267, '<td valign="top">seems like a strange setting for these bottles. I wish the DOF was a little bit less</td>', 'seems like a strange setting for these bottles. I wish the DOF was a little bit less', '2011-03-22 21:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360296, 940740, 129267, '<td valign="top">some of the action of this is taken away by the background being too close. It seems a bit like there was water sprinkled in vertical lines before the shot was taken. Those would be more dynamic if they were less straight.</td>', 'some of the action of this is taken away by the background being too close. It seems a bit like there was water sprinkled in vertical lines before the shot was taken. Those would be more dynamic if they were less straight.', '2011-03-22 21:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360297, 940127, 129267, '<td valign="top">feels a bit snapshotty. The composition is a bit weird, and the background reminds me of a grocery store.</td>', 'feels a bit snapshotty. The composition is a bit weird, and the background reminds me of a grocery store.', '2011-03-22 21:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360300, 940919, 129267, '<td valign="top">It feels like your water bottle is about to fall backward. the crop is a bit strange, especially the bottom right.</td>', 'It feels like your water bottle is about to fall backward. the crop is a bit strange, especially the bottom right.', '2011-03-22 21:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360302, 940341, 129267, '<td valign="top">I''m almost pretty sure that I would have liked this better in the ugly decomposed colors that it originally was. I think I''d like to see it more tightly cropped (remove the leaf) and make more emphasis on the horizontal nature of the bottle.</td>', 'I''m almost pretty sure that I would have liked this better in the ugly decomposed colors that it originally was. I think I''d like to see it more tightly cropped (remove the leaf) and make more emphasis on the horizontal nature of the bottle.', '2011-03-22 21:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360305, 940227, 129267, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like the cropping of the bottom of this bottle. I want to see where that leaf starts.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like the cropping of the bottom of this bottle. I want to see where that leaf starts.', '2011-03-22 21:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360307, 940952, 129267, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the bottle, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, as I sorta can make it out if I squint. The texture is nice, especially the darker areas. The top right shadow reminds me of a dinosaur. Either way, kudos for experimenting.</td>', 'I don''t see the bottle, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, as I sorta can make it out if I squint. The texture is nice, especially the darker areas. The top right shadow reminds me of a dinosaur. Either way, kudos for experimenting.', '2011-03-22 21:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6360308, 940803, 129267, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would do well. the exposure seems a bit low, especially the dark purple.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would do well. the exposure seems a bit low, especially the dark purple.', '2011-03-22 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
