(6360871, 940810, 43774, '<td valign="top">Welcome back!!!! And congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Welcome back!!!! And congrats on the ribbon.', '2011-03-23 05:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360872, 940810, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good to see you back Irene.  I hope you are starting to feel better - health issues are rough stuff.  <br/> <br/>I left a comment during voting and was editing it but somehow it got lost.  Anyway, I loved the composition and the colors but I almost wonder if the image is a bit oversharpened around the cap of the bottle.</td>', 'Good to see you back Irene.  I hope you are starting to feel better - health issues are rough stuff.   I left a comment during voting and was editing it but somehow it got lost.  Anyway, I loved the composition and the colors but I almost wonder if the image is a bit oversharpened around the cap of the bottle.', '2011-03-23 06:03:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360874, 940811, 67152, '<td valign="top">Oliver - excuses! excuses!  I did notice the bottle top out of focus and it did cost you a point or two. It is amazing how such a small detail as DOF can make the difference.<br/> <br/>Anyway - good work as always - at least the splash is in focus.  One of these days you will get a hang of studio stuff ;-P</td>', 'Oliver - excuses! excuses!  I did notice the bottle top out of focus and it did cost you a point or two. It is amazing how such a small detail as DOF can make the difference. Anyway - good work as always - at least the splash is in focus.  One of these days you will get a hang of studio stuff ;-P', '2011-03-23 06:06:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360877, 940811, 49109, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bassbone:</b></div><hr/><i> Oliver - excuses! excuses!  I did notice the bottle top out of focus and it did cost you a point or two. It is amazing how such a small detail as DOF can make the difference.<br/> <br/>Anyway - good work as always - at least the splash is in focus.  One of these days you will get a hang of studio stuff ;-P </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No need for excuses, peter,  I knew it would be noticed when I submitted. Regarding the studio stuff - ahem, that''s what I make a living from, so if I ever got the hang (I doubt that), I would still have to do it ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by bassbone: Oliver - excuses! excuses!  I did notice the bottle top out of focus and it did cost you a point or two. It is amazing how such a small detail as DOF can make the difference. Anyway - good work as always - at least the splash is in focus.  One of these days you will get a hang of studio stuff ;-P   No need for excuses, peter,  I knew it would be noticed when I submitted. Regarding the studio stuff - ahem, that''s what I make a living from, so if I ever got the hang (I doubt that), I would still have to do it ;-)', '2011-03-23 06:11:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360880, 940810, 103142, '<td valign="top">wheee!!!! Irene is back!!!<br/> <br/>Ummmm... wait... Irene''s too good. That means less ribbons for everyone else...<br/> <br/>Drat!!!!! Irene is back!!!<br/> <br/>Wait... but I didn''t enter water bottle...<br/> <br/>Wheee!!!! Irene is back!!!<br/></td>', 'wheee!!!! Irene is back!!! Ummmm... wait... Irene''s too good. That means less ribbons for everyone else... Drat!!!!! Irene is back!!! Wait... but I didn''t enter water bottle... Wheee!!!! Irene is back!!!', '2011-03-23 06:15:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360888, 940810, 114969, '<td valign="top">Irene, I was so missing your entries! I am so happy that you are back. I really hope you will be able to enter as much as you want in the upcoming challenges.<br/>By the way, that''s a fantastic way to come back :-) Congratulations on the blue!</td>', 'Irene, I was so missing your entries! I am so happy that you are back. I really hope you will be able to enter as much as you want in the upcoming challenges.By the way, that''s a fantastic way to come back :-) Congratulations on the blue!', '2011-03-23 06:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360895, 940811, 103142, '<td valign="top">oooh!! Thanks for the explanation! I''m reading the speedlighter''s handbook, and I just read the part about higher output = longer duration. But I hadn''t put it together with equaling more blur (I haven''t experimented that much, yet...) What a wonderful nugget of info!<br/> <br/>Great shot! I didn''t notice/care about the bottle top. :D<br/> <br/>Congrats on the red!!</td>', 'oooh!! Thanks for the explanation! I''m reading the speedlighter''s handbook, and I just read the part about higher output = longer duration. But I hadn''t put it together with equaling more blur (I haven''t experimented that much, yet...) What a wonderful nugget of info! Great shot! I didn''t notice/care about the bottle top. :D Congrats on the red!!', '2011-03-23 06:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6360900, 940810, 34938, '<td valign="top">I have missed you so muh Irene..welcome back</td>', 'I have missed you so muh Irene..welcome back', '2011-03-23 06:43:56.000000', NULL, 0),
