(6360910, 940295, 113278, '<td valign="top">Man tough crowd. This shot shows how well you know how to produce quality shots. The exposure is perfect, beautiful focus and depth of field, extraordinary detail and a pleasing composition.</td>', 'Man tough crowd. This shot shows how well you know how to produce quality shots. The exposure is perfect, beautiful focus and depth of field, extraordinary detail and a pleasing composition.', '2011-03-23 07:01:51.000000', NULL, 0),
