(6361141, 940923, 92994, '<td valign="top">Thanks, everyone, for your comments.  I wasn''t expecting much, especially since I didn''t put a lot of time into this one.  I had thought about a square crop, but wanted to include the water; although the water appeared more out of focus than I would have liked.  I do enjoy long exposures, and this was fun to experiment with.  Thanks again!</td>', 'Thanks, everyone, for your comments.  I wasn''t expecting much, especially since I didn''t put a lot of time into this one.  I had thought about a square crop, but wanted to include the water; although the water appeared more out of focus than I would have liked.  I do enjoy long exposures, and this was fun to experiment with.  Thanks again!', '2011-03-23 10:41:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6361161, 940810, 42256, '<td valign="top">Congrats and welcome back!<br/> <br/>LOL<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/congrats_irene3.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/congrats_irene3.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/congrats_irene3.png"/> <br/> <br/>(Sorry, it''s been in storage for a long time) ;-) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Congrats and welcome back! LOLOriginally posted by Art Roflmao:   (Sorry, it''s been in storage for a long time) ;-) ', '2011-03-23 11:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
