(6361195, 940810, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, welcome back, Irene.  While I am sorry to hear you have had health problems, it sounds as if you are on the road to wellness again.  Certainly your photography has not suffered.  <br/> <br/>This is soooo good, and yes, I was one of the ''23''.</td>', 'Oh, welcome back, Irene.  While I am sorry to hear you have had health problems, it sounds as if you are on the road to wellness again.  Certainly your photography has not suffered.   This is soooo good, and yes, I was one of the ''23''.', '2011-03-23 11:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
