(6362295, 940829, 30446, '<td valign="top">Okay. I think I was voted on pretty harshly on this one. I feel I have had worse entries that scored higher.  I interepreted the instructions as use a water bottle in the photo not neccisarily the actual subject. Yes Slugs are kind of grose but I still respect their place in the scheme of things. I did not kill it after the shoot I let it go. But I did as a child until I knew better. I am unsure why it scored as lowly as it did when other more cruel images have even won ribbons. I did not expect to place I do agree with the DOF comment as well as the other <i>technical</i> comments. Im sorry if this offended you I didnt think It would get  too much negative feedback. Ive never been this confused by any of my ratings, Im no Ansel Adams I know that.</td>', 'Okay. I think I was voted on pretty harshly on this one. I feel I have had worse entries that scored higher.  I interepreted the instructions as use a water bottle in the photo not neccisarily the actual subject. Yes Slugs are kind of grose but I still respect their place in the scheme of things. I did not kill it after the shoot I let it go. But I did as a child until I knew better. I am unsure why it scored as lowly as it did when other more cruel images have even won ribbons. I did not expect to place I do agree with the DOF comment as well as the other technical comments. Im sorry if this offended you I didnt think It would get  too much negative feedback. Ive never been this confused by any of my ratings, Im no Ansel Adams I know that.', '2011-03-24 09:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
