(6362429, 940810, 24454, '<td valign="top">Irene! This is so beautiful!  So "Irene".  I have been so busy and have had to be sporadic about challenges myself, but I did notice that I wasn''t seeing you as much and was hoping you were okay.  I am so sorry you''ve had such a hard time with health issues!!  But what a treat to be welcomed back with a glorious blue ribbon!  I pray every day will find you closer to 100% and we can start seeing those Irene ribbons every week like before  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Irene! This is so beautiful!  So "Irene".  I have been so busy and have had to be sporadic about challenges myself, but I did notice that I wasn''t seeing you as much and was hoping you were okay.  I am so sorry you''ve had such a hard time with health issues!!  But what a treat to be welcomed back with a glorious blue ribbon!  I pray every day will find you closer to 100% and we can start seeing those Irene ribbons every week like before  :) ', '2011-03-24 14:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
