(6363215, 940820, 55283, '<td valign="top">It just dawned on me. My comment really reminded me of some comments made by test subjects in a book I read.<br/>//www.amazon.com/Subliminal-Seduction-Wilson-Bryan-Key/dp/0451061489<br/>It discusses (among other things)marketers embedding the word "SEX" in their print advertising. I''ve since found them in print ads before, and now there is actually a couple in here. Was that intentional? I screen capped your image and can PM you a highlighted version, if you like. If it really was intentional, well done, especially in basic.<br/></td>', 'It just dawned on me. My comment really reminded me of some comments made by test subjects in a book I read.//www.amazon.com/Subliminal-Seduction-Wilson-Bryan-Key/dp/0451061489It discusses (among other things)marketers embedding the word "SEX" in their print advertising. I''ve since found them in print ads before, and now there is actually a couple in here. Was that intentional? I screen capped your image and can PM you a highlighted version, if you like. If it really was intentional, well done, especially in basic.', '2011-03-25 01:34:26.000000', NULL, 0),
