(6363841, 939901, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lovely X-ray. <br/> <br/>I was sure this was negative. I took a screenshot, dumped it in my photo editor, and inverted it. To my surprise, it still looked negative! It was just a curiosity. Didn''t get to vote in this one, but for sure, this would have been a top pick from me.</td>', 'Lovely X-ray.  I was sure this was negative. I took a screenshot, dumped it in my photo editor, and inverted it. To my surprise, it still looked negative! It was just a curiosity. Didn''t get to vote in this one, but for sure, this would have been a top pick from me.', '2011-03-26 10:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
