(6385184, 940263, 126709, '<td valign="top">I look forward to other entries you submit.  Kabul, or Afghanistan is a photographer''s paradise.  Just look around and you can find something for every challenge.  Mud buildings, donkey carts in traffic, kids, people in general with some spectacular lighting and lest I forget, Jinga trucks with their ordinate decorations (and loads).  Good luck with the challenges and stay safe.<br/> <br/>I forgot to mention the incredible landscapes.  Mountains, terraced hillsides, and sunsets.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-13 14:06:23.</i></td>', 'I look forward to other entries you submit.  Kabul, or Afghanistan is a photographer''s paradise.  Just look around and you can find something for every challenge.  Mud buildings, donkey carts in traffic, kids, people in general with some spectacular lighting and lest I forget, Jinga trucks with their ordinate decorations (and loads).  Good luck with the challenges and stay safe. I forgot to mention the incredible landscapes.  Mountains, terraced hillsides, and sunsets.  ', '2011-04-13 15:01:37.000000', '2011-04-13 15:06:23.000000', 0),
